==Dutch==

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|nl|Zaterdag}}, {{l|nl|Zaturdag}}, {{l|nl|zaturdag}} {{qualifier|obsolete spellings}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|saterdach}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|}}, from {{inh|nl|gmw-pro|*Sāturnas dag}}, calque of {{der|nl|la|dies Saturni}}. Compare {{cog|nds|Saterdag}}, {{cog|fy|saterdei}}, {{cog|en|Saturday}}.

[[Saturn]] or [[Saturnus]] is the sixth planet of the [[solar system]], and it was the name ot the [[Roman]] god of fertility and agriculture.

